## 6. LA FORMULE DE PROMPT IMAGE — 10 composants (validée en production)

C'est l'actif principal, plus important qu'une bibliothèque photo.

| # | Composant | Exemple |
|---|-----------|---------|
| 1 | Format | `Editorial lifestyle photograph, 4:5 portrait format` |
| 2 | **Cadrage partiel** | `hands and forearm entering the frame from the left edge` / `close-medium framing showing head and shoulders` |
| 3 | Sujet + état | `in profile, eyes closed, serene relaxed expression, natural skin texture, mid-30s` |
| 4 | Décor | `warm off-white textured plaster wall, softly blurred` |
| 5 | **Simulation d'objectif** | `shallow depth of field (50mm f/2 look)` |
| 6 | Lumière | `soft natural side light from a window, gentle shadows, no flash` |
| 7 | **Accent couleur unique** | `single color accent: a terracotta clay-colored towel, everything else in cream, warm beige and natural skin tones` |
| 8 | Étalonnage | `muted desaturated palette, subtle film grain, premium wellness editorial style, not stock photography` |
| 9 | **Espace négatif** | `large negative space in the upper third of the frame` (réservé au texte overlay) |
| 10 | Exclusions | `no text, no logo, no watermark` |

### Règles issues de la formule
- **Le cadrage partiel (2) est la clé anatomie.** Mains, avant-bras, profils, plans serrés → pas de membres à compter. Éviter les poses corps entier.
- **L'espace négatif (9) est obligatoire pour tout visuel de carousel** — c'est là que va le texte.
- **L'accent couleur unique (7) impose la DA** sans retouche.
- **La simulation d'objectif (5) supprime le look « IA ».**

### Gabarit de référence complet
```
Editorial lifestyle photograph, 4:5 portrait format. A Pilates instructor's hands and forearm
entering the frame from the left edge, gently adjusting the shoulder alignment of a woman lying
on a cream Pilates mat. The student is in profile, eyes closed, serene relaxed expression,
natural skin texture, mid-30s. Close-medium framing showing head and shoulders. Background:
warm off-white textured plaster wall, softly blurred, shallow depth of field (50mm f/2 look).
Soft natural side light from a window, gentle shadows, no flash. Single color accent: a
terracotta clay-colored towel or top, everything else in cream, warm beige and natural skin
tones. Muted desaturated palette, subtle film grain, premium wellness editorial style, not
stock photography. Large negative space in the upper third of the frame. No text, no logo,
no watermark.
```

### 10 variantes de gabarit à décliner
`mains-ajustement` · `profil-respiration` · `detail-tapis` · `barre-cadrage-serre` ·
`renfo-gainage-partiel` · `objet-nature-morte` · `ambiance-studio-vide` · `hanches-bassin` ·
`dos-posture` · `sommeil-recuperation`

